{"disposition":"return_to_vendor","reasoning":"INV-3010 is rejected under F1 because the invoice is denominated in EUR while Acme pays only in USD. A wrong currency is a correctable defect, so the vendor may fix and resubmit rather than having the invoice voided. The payment gate blocks the 2,000 EUR total until a USD invoice is received.","vendor_reply":"Hello Global Supply Chain Partners billing team,

We cannot process invoice INV-3010 (dated 2026-02-17, total 2,000.00 EUR, one line: WidgetB, quantity 4 at 500.00) because it is issued in EUR and we pay only in USD. Please resubmit a corrected invoice in USD that shows the line amounts, subtotal, and total in USD and confirms the quantities and unit prices you intend to bill.

Thank you."}
